{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_jdy23w6evlfu4p3imivhxlhunwnfszomd3az5ehs2t3pukncvxrq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01ByXw5ExPszYD2Tk7ixWMK3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> SYMBOLS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Results\n\n| configuration | `cargo check` | `cargo build` | `nm -D` diff vs C | undefined non-libc |\n|---------------|---------------|---------------|-------------------|--------------------|\n| features `<none>`, profile `debug`   | PASS | PASS | **empty** | **none** |\n| features `<none>`, profile `release` | PASS | PASS | **empty** | **none** |\n\nReproduce with `./verify_all.sh` (enumerates the feature power set out of\n`Cargo.toml`, builds the C `.so`, diffs `nm -D` and runs the whole test suite\nfor every combination x profile).\n\n```\n=== Feature enumeration (from Cargo.toml) ===\n  declared non-default features: 0 (none)\n  feature combinations to verify: 1\n    - '<none>'\n...\n=== RESULT ===\n  ALL CONFIGURATIONS VERIFIED\n```\nEOF\necho done"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":137106,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":624,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd53fac5-42d8-4ad0-b1aa-0e97b26d290e","uuid":"35cae270-400f-4991-8357-1041d9495332","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:38:22.223Z"}
